# 🐦 PIGEON — QUANTUM MAGNETORECEPTION

## Architecture
```
Pigeons can SEE the electromagnetic grid.
They have cryptochrome proteins in their retinas.
Quantum entanglement enables magnetic field detection.
They literally see the Earth's magnetic field lines.
```

## Biological Mechanism
```
CRYPTOCHROME QUANTUM PROCESS:

1. Blue light hits cryptochrome protein
2. Electron pair forms (radical pair)
3. Electrons become quantum entangled
4. Earth's magnetic field affects spin states
5. Different orientations → different chemical products
6. Pigeon perceives magnetic field as visual pattern

QUANTUM COHERENCE TIME: ~1-100 μs
SENSITIVITY: ~50 nT (Earth field ≈ 25-65 μT)
```

